msgctxt "124"
msgid ""
"Evening there, Kiryu-san. How's that little scrap of land been treating "
"you? Can't be too bad, what with the beachfront view and all. Haha!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid ""
"Sorry, Miyara-san, but I don't have time for small talk right now. Have you "
"seen Izumi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid "Izumi-chan? Can't say I have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid "Damn..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Hmmm. Have you checked down at the beach? I see her there\r\n"
"staring out at the ocean every now and again. Might be a good place to "
"start."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "I'll do that. Thanks, Miyara-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid ""
"No problem at all. I imagine she spends that time reminiscing\r\n"
"about her parents. She lost them at such a young age..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Hey, Miyara-san. What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Oh, Kiryu-san... Some little bigshot yakuza boys from the\r\n"
"Ryudo Family came by and said they were going to \"boot me\r\n"
"off my land,\" or else they'd put a \"boot up my ass.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Did they come threaten you, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "Yeah. So they're the Ryudo Family, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Mmhm. Not that I care. They can come waving their deed in\r\n"
"front of me all they want, but kicking me out? No siree."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"My wife and I have been calling this tiny speck of Earth\r\n"
"home for decades now. No way am I going to simply roll\r\n"
"over and let them take that away from us."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "I imagine you have similar concerns, with your kids and all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I'm gonna talk to them, see if there's any way we can\r\n"
"forget about this whole thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"Oh, that would be fantastic, Kiryu-san! I wish I knew why\r\n"
"they're doing this all of a sudden. The two kids the family\r\n"
"has working for them are usually so polite..."
msgstr ""

